  title: 'Gameplay: Knockdown'
  sections:
  - heading: Play
    text: Open Assets/Scenes/Knockdown.unity, enter Play mode, choose Static or Moving, and start the round.
    linkText: Project instructions
    url: https://github.com/ainere/GAMEDEV/tree/knockdown
  - heading: Controls
    text: Move the mouse to turn the camera. Aim with the centered crosshair and click or hold the left mouse button to throw darts. Escape pauses and releases the cursor for menus.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Modes
    text: Static cutouts fold down and stand back up in place. Moving targets travel on three conveyor rows and reset only behind the side covers. Each knockdown earns 10 points during a 60-second round.
    linkText: Course submissions
    url: https://github.com/ainere/GAMEDEV/tree/main
  loadedLayout: 1
